From f11f2d2d392e63d24d3ead04564213637456dece Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:31:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/44] ours: dedup the mmap expert-cache helpers and drop a
 no-op (no behaviour change)

- moe_cache_expert_copy: one inlined copy body for the one-fill, stage and route kernels
- expert_copy_src_locked: one "where are expert e's bytes" choice (arena slot / RAM-tier slot / registered alias)
  for the routed fill, the 6-argument stage_table and prefill in place
- dr_map_refresh_locked: one rebuild + upload of the device expert -> slot map (devremap and prefill in place)
- seed_fill_slot_locked: one sparse-or-host seed fill (heat seed and the all-resident sizing copy)
- ggml_cuda_pin_chunk_upload: one pinned-chunk row-streaming loop (set_tensor_2d serial fallback, splice slot fallback)
- sparse_guard_locked removed (empty since lazy registration; its note moved to access_locked)

Prod model (1 R9700, prod config): greedy a266d1025664, 259.6k needle correct; q30 / q36 replies unchanged.
